{
  "title": "Proxmox (pve)",
  "uid": "homelab-proxmox",
  "description": "Ersetzt das Fremd-Dashboard 24550, das fuer den prometheus-pve-exporter gebaut ist: von dessen 50 Metriken liefert der hier laufende bigtcze/pve-exporter nur 22, der Rest der Panels blieb leer. Kein SMART, keine Disk-Temperaturen, kein IO-Wait, keine Netz-Zaehler auf Node-Ebene. Das ist kein Verlust, denn pve haengt seit 2026-08-07 zusaetzlich als node-exporter mit drin: Temperaturen, Disk-IO und Netz auf Blech-Ebene stehen im Dashboard Node Overview. Dieses Board zeigt, was nur die Proxmox-API weiss, also die Gaeste und die Storages.",
  "tags": ["homelab", "proxmox"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "pve",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_up)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "online", "color": "green", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red", "index": 1 } } }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Uptime",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 3, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_uptime_seconds)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CPU",
      "description": "pve_node_cpu_load heisst so, ist aber die CPU-Auslastung als Anteil von 0 bis 1, kein Load-Average. Das echte Load-Average von pve steht im Node Overview (node_load1).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_cpu_load)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.9 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RAM",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 9, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_memory_used_bytes) / max(pve_node_memory_total_bytes)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.85 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.95 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Swap",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_swap_used_bytes) / clamp_min(max(pve_node_swap_total_bytes), 1)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "VMs",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 15, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(max by (vmid) (pve_vm_status) == 1) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "laufend",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(max by (vmid) (pve_vm_status))",
          "legendFormat": "gesamt",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LXCs",
      "description": "Fehlen hier Container, die auf pve laufen, dann fehlen dem API-Token die Rechte darauf: der Exporter listet nur, was die Proxmox-API ihm zeigt.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 19, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(max by (vmid) (pve_lxc_status) == 1) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "laufend",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(max by (vmid) (pve_lxc_status))",
          "legendFormat": "gesamt",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Security-Updates",
      "description": "Offene Pakete aus einer Security-Origin. AptSecurityUpdatesPending meldet sich, wenn der Wert 72h am Stueck ueber 0 steht. Der Wert ist nach arch aufgeteilt, deshalb die Summe. Nur pve hat einen apt-Textfile-Collector, der macmini und die Talos-Nodes tauchen hier nicht auf.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(apt_upgrades_pending{origin=~\".*security.*\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Updates gesamt",
      "description": "Alle Origins zusammen, inklusive Proxmox. Auf einem pve-Host praktisch immer groesser 0 und deshalb ohne Schwelle und ohne Alert. Steht hier als Kontext zur Zahl links.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 3, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(apt_upgrades_pending)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reboot nötig",
      "description": "Kommt aus /var/run/reboot-required und faellt nur durch den Reboot selbst zurueck. Auf pve schreibt das praktisch nur dbus: der Proxmox-Kernel setzt es nicht, dafuer ist die Kachel rechts zustaendig. Auf pve liegen talos-cp-1 und der Blocky-LXC, der Reboot kostet also ein etcd-Member von dreien.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(node_reboot_required)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "nein", "color": "green", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "JA", "color": "red", "index": 1 } } }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Kernel",
      "description": "Vergleicht den laufenden Kernel mit dem installierten (needrestart). Das ist auf pve das einzige belastbare Reboot-Signal, weil der Proxmox-Kernel kein /var/run/reboot-required schreibt. HostKernelOutdated meldet sich, wenn der Wert 24h ueber 1 steht.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 9, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(needrestart_kernel_status_info)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "unbekannt", "color": "yellow", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "aktuell", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "2": { "text": "ABI alt", "color": "red", "index": 2 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "3": { "text": "Version alt", "color": "red", "index": 3 } } }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dienste-Neustart",
      "description": "Prozesse, die noch gegen ersetzte Bibliotheken laufen (needrestart). Bewusst ohne Alert: nach jedem Security-Update steht hier etwas, und es faellt erst durch den Neustart der Dienste oder den Reboot zurueck. Welche es sind, zeigt: ssh pve 'needrestart -b'",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(needrestart_services_total)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Verlauf offene Updates",
      "description": "Zeigt, ob der Rueckstand waechst oder gerade gepatcht wurde. Der Absturz nach unten ist ein apt upgrade, ein flacher Anstieg sind neu veroeffentlichte Pakete. Hier mit der Aufteilung security gegen gesamt, die es nur auf pve gibt; das Alter der Textfiles und der Vergleich mit dem macmini stehen in Node Overview.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 9, "x": 15, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(apt_upgrades_pending{origin=~\".*security.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "security"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(apt_upgrades_pending)",
          "legendFormat": "gesamt"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU-Auslastung pve",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_cpu_load)",
          "legendFormat": "pve"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": false },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Speicher pve",
      "description": "Belegt und gesamt als absolute Werte, damit sichtbar bleibt, wie viel Luft fuer weitere VMs da ist.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_memory_used_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "belegt"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_memory_total_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "gesamt"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_swap_used_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "Swap"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "gesamt" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "dash": [6, 6], "fill": "dash" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Storage-Füllstand",
      "description": "nvme-2tb ist die 2TB-NVMe auf /mnt/nvme-2tb, dort liegen die Disks von k3s-worker-1 und vm-arch (frueher longhorn-storage). nas-nfs ist der NFS-Mount vom UniFi-NAS, local-lvm traegt die restlichen VM-Disks.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (storage, type) (pve_storage_used_bytes / clamp_min(pve_storage_total_bytes, 1))",
          "legendFormat": "{{storage}} ({{type}})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.9 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Gäste",
      "description": "VMs und LXCs in einer Tabelle. Das Typ-Label entsteht per label_replace, weil der Exporter VMs und Container in getrennten Metrikfamilien fuehrt. Belegter Gast-Speicherplatz fehlt absichtlich: pve_vm_disk_used_bytes ist ohne QEMU-Guest-Agent immer 0, deshalb steht hier nur die zugewiesene Disk-Groesse.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "label_replace(max by (name, vmid) (pve_vm_status), \"typ\", \"VM\", \"name\", \".*\") or label_replace(max by (name, vmid) (pve_lxc_status), \"typ\", \"LXC\", \"name\", \".*\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_cpu_usage) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_cpu_usage)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_cpus) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_cpus)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_memory_used_bytes / clamp_min(pve_vm_memory_max_bytes, 1)) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_memory_used_bytes / clamp_min(pve_lxc_memory_max_bytes, 1))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_disk_max_bytes) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_disk_max_bytes)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_uptime_seconds) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_uptime_seconds)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
